{"3664280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Catfighter, In the Lands of Sinners", "steam_appid": 3664280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/c54ccee02a5586f22f54af538f3f9a4f.avif?t=1769119982\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras_big/c54ccee02a5586f22f54af538f3f9a4f.webp?t=1769119982 width=1560 height=763 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;Welcome to the best shop in the whole Lands of Sinners! How much gold coins do you have? Give me ALL OF THEM!!!&quot;</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/dd79571640d51832795fb7bab52b9009.apng?t=1769119982\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/dd79571640d51832795fb7bab52b9009.poster.avif?t=1769119982\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=176 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>-Kevin</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catfighter is a 2D pixel game where the player shapes the fate of the main character, Mickesh. Players can expect a dark fantasy story, challenging boss fights, and the horrors that await him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/1bf94e048e0fdc79c00a001e246b4e3e.avif?t=1769119982\" width=192 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But will Mickesh face the darkness, or become the horror <i><strong>himself</strong></i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/de28e7a1857e12b8e7a50dd06b4c5ebc.poster.avif?t=1769119982\" width=448 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/de28e7a1857e12b8e7a50dd06b4c5ebc.webm?t=1769119982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The game features multiple biomes for the player to explore.</strong> Each boss’s story is revealed when entering their biome or a specific location. Players can save their progress at the <i>bonbox</i>, in which Mickesh can also hide. For some grotesque, cartoonish reason, the bonbox teleports him directly in front of Kevin’s shop, where he can empty his pockets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By touching the red portal next to the shop, players can return to their last bonbox. In the <strong>Lands of Sinners</strong>, nothing is truly normal and all oddities are part of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players must take care of Mickesh, ensuring he doesn’t get harmed. After all, you wouldn’t want to hurt a cute cat… right?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mickesh needs to stay healthy and @L1v3, so it’s recommended to drink milk by pressing <strong>E</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He can roll in any direction by pressing <strong>SPACE</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mickesh can draw a sword from his pockets and use it for <u><i><strong>self-defense</strong></i></u>, either with the arrow keys or the Q<strong> </strong>button (for parrying). He may not be the brightest, but one thing’s certain: he would never use his tail as a weapon.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Good luck exploring the Lands of Sinners!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/c54ccee02a5586f22f54af538f3f9a4f.avif?t=1769119982\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras_big/c54ccee02a5586f22f54af538f3f9a4f.webp?t=1769119982 width=1560 height=763 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>&quot;Welcome to the best shop in the whole Lands of Sinners! How much gold coins do you have? Give me ALL OF THEM!!!&quot;</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/dd79571640d51832795fb7bab52b9009.apng?t=1769119982\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/dd79571640d51832795fb7bab52b9009.poster.avif?t=1769119982\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=176 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>-Kevin</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catfighter is a 2D pixel game where the player shapes the fate of the main character, Mickesh. Players can expect a dark fantasy story, challenging boss fights, and the horrors that await him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664280/extras/1bf94e048e0fdc79c00a001e246b4e3e.avif?t=1769119982\" width=192 height=228 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But will Mickesh face the darkness, or become the horror <i><strong>himself</strong></i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span cla